# ==========================================================================
# CyberOps & AI Workstation Lab - security-focused .gitignore
# Purpose: keep secrets, credentials, personal data and machine-local state
#          out of version control. Sanitized project source and docs are
#          intentionally NOT ignored.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Cryptographic material / keys / certificates ---
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.jks
*.keystore
*.asc
*.gpg
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
*.ppk

# --- Password managers / secret stores ---
*.kdbx
*.kdb
*.opvault
*.agilekeychain

# --- Environment / secret / token files ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.token
*.secret
*.secrets
secret
secrets
secrets.*
credential
credentials
credentials.*
credentials*
secrets*
*apikey*
*api_key*
*.apikey
auth.json
.netrc
_netrc

# --- BitLocker / recovery keys ---
*BitLocker*Recovery*Key*
*recovery-key*
*recovery_key*

# --- Machine / hardware reports that may contain identifiers ---
battery-report-*.html
battery-report*.html
energy-report*.html
*-systeminfo-*.txt
*dxdiag*.txt
msinfo32*.nfo

# --- Internal working files: kept local, not part of the public portfolio ---
# CLAUDE.md is the local AI-assistant operating agreement for this repo (its
# substance is summarised in README "Security Approach"). The local organizational
# manual and the raw per-batch execution logs are internal workflow records, not
# portfolio evidence.
#
# Batch reports 1, 2, 4, 4D and 5 were curated, privacy-reviewed and published
# earlier; they stay tracked via the negation lines below. EVERY other
# BATCH_*_RESULTS.md is treated as an internal log and kept local. Note: git
# ignore rules never remove an already-tracked file, so the negations only need to
# cover reports that are currently tracked.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/ORGANIZACION_DIGITAL.md
RECOVERED_DESKTOP_CURRENT_STATE.md
BRAVE_BOOKMARK_BACKUP_RESULTS.md
EPSON_WF2950_SETUP_RESULTS.md

BATCH_*_RESULTS.md
!BATCH_1_RESULTS.md
!BATCH_2_RESULTS.md
!BATCH_4_RESULTS.md
!BATCH_4D_RESULTS.md
!BATCH_5_RESULTS.md

# --- Personal backups / recovered data (do NOT track) ---
Recovered-Desktop/
Recovered-Desktop
RecoveredDesktop/
personal-backups/
personal_backups/
Backups/
backup/
backups/
*.bak

# --- Downloads / large or transient user content ---
Downloads/
downloads/

# --- Temporary / log / cache files ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.cache
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
tmp/
temp/
cache/
.cache/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
pip-log.txt

# --- IDE / editor local state ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.sample.json
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# --- OS / shell history that may leak commands or hosts ---
.bash_history
.python_history
ConsoleHost_history.txt

# --- Archives that are likely raw captures, not source ---
SysinternalsSuite*.zip
*.evtx
